<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
    <title>Página no encontrada — SoloLatino.Net</title>
    <style>
        *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
        body{background:#07070d;color:#e8e8f8;font-family:'Outfit',system-ui,sans-serif;
             min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:1rem}
        .card{background:#0f0f1a;border:1px solid #1e1e3a;border-radius:1rem;
              padding:3rem 2.5rem;max-width:480px;width:100%;text-align:center}
        .icon{font-size:3.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:block}
        .code{font-size:5rem;font-weight:800;color:#e50914;line-height:1;margin-bottom:.5rem}
        h1{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.75rem}
        p{color:#9090b8;line-height:1.6;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
        .btn{display:inline-block;background:#e50914;color:#fff;border-radius:.6rem;
             padding:.65rem 1.75rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;
             transition:background .15s}
        .btn:hover{background:#ff2020}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="code">404</div>
        <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
        <p>El contenido que buscas no existe o fue removido.</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Volver al inicio</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
